blackm-welcome-sender-default = Facility Administration
blackm-welcome-title-default = Staff notice
blackm-welcome-msg-1 = { $name }, your badge is active. Position: { $job }. Proceed to your workstation and do not linger in transit areas.
blackm-welcome-msg-2 = Good morning, { $name }. Reminder: Black Mesa is a restricted facility. Keep your badge visible and stay out of sectors you are not cleared for.
blackm-welcome-msg-3 = { $name }, your shift has started. In an emergency, follow security instructions and do not leave your sector.
blackm-welcome-msg-4 = Welcome to your shift, { $name }. Administration reminds you that tardiness and leaving your post are recorded.
blackm-welcome-msg-5 = { $name }, the access system has confirmed your identity. Have a good shift - and don't touch anything without instructions.

blackm-welcome-sender-security = Head of Security
blackm-welcome-title-security = Security Service
blackm-welcome-sec-1 = { $name }, take your post. Check badges, hold the perimeter and report anything suspicious.
blackm-welcome-sec-2 = { $name }, shift accepted. Weapons by the book only. Don't rattle the scientists without reason.
blackm-welcome-sec-3 = { $name }, scheduled tests in the labs today. Stay close and keep your eyes open.

blackm-welcome-sender-science = Research Department
blackm-welcome-title-science = Science Sector
blackm-welcome-sci-1 = { $name }, your lab clearance is confirmed. Check the protocol and your protective suit before any experiment.
blackm-welcome-sci-2 = Good morning, { $name }. Reminder: samples from the test area must not leave the lab.
blackm-welcome-sci-3 = { $name }, today is an important day for science. Try not to make it the last one.

blackm-welcome-sender-medical = Medical Block
blackm-welcome-title-medical = Medical Service
blackm-welcome-med-1 = { $name }, the medbay is waiting. Check your supplies - shifts here rarely go by without injuries.
blackm-welcome-med-2 = Welcome, { $name }. Casualties from test areas are screened for contamination first and treated second.

blackm-welcome-sender-engineering = Facility Services
blackm-welcome-title-engineering = Technical Sector
blackm-welcome-eng-1 = { $name }, the lights, air and doors of this facility depend on you. Don't restart anything unless you have to.
blackm-welcome-eng-2 = { $name }, your shift has started. Check the sector power grid and stay in touch with dispatch.

blackm-welcome-sender-cargo = Logistics
blackm-welcome-title-cargo = Facility Supply
blackm-welcome-cargo-1 = { $name }, several deliveries are scheduled today. Check the manifests: everything entering the facility must be accounted for.
blackm-welcome-cargo-2 = { $name }, the warehouse is yours. Do not open sealed cargo and do not ask about it.

blackm-welcome-sender-hecu = HECU Command
blackm-welcome-title-hecu = Combat orders
blackm-welcome-hecu-1 = { $name }, you have arrived with the HECU unit. Follow orders strictly and do not deviate from the objective.
blackm-welcome-hecu-2 = { $name }, insertion confirmed. The facility is under observation. Keep comms open and await further orders.

blackm-welcome-sender-representative = Black Mesa Board of Directors
blackm-welcome-title-representative = Confidential
blackm-welcome-rep-1 = { $name }, the board is counting on your reports. Make sure company interests are upheld in every sector.
blackm-welcome-rep-2 = { $name }, a reminder: what happens in the facility stays in the facility. Report protocol violations directly.

blackm-welcome-sender-captain = Government Contractor
blackm-welcome-title-captain = Closed channel
blackm-welcome-captain-1 = { $name }. The facility is now in your hands. My employers... are watching the results closely.
blackm-welcome-captain-2 = { $name }. You have been entrusted with running this facility. Try to... justify that trust. We will be in touch.
blackm-welcome-captain-3 = Congratulations on your appointment, { $name }. Not every decision here will be yours... but the responsibility is entirely yours.
